id: pm-96tter
title: "GH-688: seeded Plan creation must be atomic across ownership boundaries"
description: Make pm plan create with seeded steps and linked artifacts preflight or transact ownership so a failed enrichment cannot leave a partial Plan when author and assignee differ.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:plan",atomicity,gh-issue,multi-agent
created_at: "2026-07-25T00:58:27.692Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-26T17:08:08.133Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-25T15:27:14.045Z"
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: A cross-owner seeded plan either persists all requested steps/artifacts or leaves no Plan; CLI and SDK regression tests cover success and rollback.
parent: pm-mpbb
release: v2026.7.26
resolution: Seeded cross-owner Plan creation validates first and persists one complete Plan state.
expected_result: Seeded cross-owner Plan creation validates first and persists one complete Plan state.
actual_result: "Seeded cross-owner Plan creation validates first and persists one complete Plan state. Verification: linked tests, full coverage, static/security gates, and packed consumer passed."
